dams County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/north-dakota/adams-county"],["ARC or PLC in Adams County","/arc-plc/north-dakota/adams-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids shows October to November under 90% of normal in 46 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids ran 198% of normal in April to May and 197% in October to November. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids has run 64% of normal in May to June and 60% in June to July.</p>"}
